MODULE: ReplayConvergesCrashForgetsHighWater
TARGET: ReplayConverges
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a crash treats the checkpoint as the high-water mark, so the view is assumed to reflect exactly the checkpointed prefix while it still serves later entries
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
    /\ applied' = ckpt /\ rb' = "idle"
    /\ pubTree' = bound /\ pubPos' = ckpt
    /\ crashes' = crashes + 1
    /\ UNCHANGED <<SourceVars, trim, ttlUsed, driftUsed, drifted, bound, vval,
                   hw, ckpt,
--- REPLACE
    /\ applied' = ckpt /\ rb' = "idle" /\ hw' = ckpt
    /\ pubTree' = bound /\ pubPos' = ckpt
    /\ crashes' = crashes + 1
    /\ UNCHANGED <<SourceVars, trim, ttlUsed, driftUsed, drifted, bound, vval,
                   ckpt,
--- END